uth, east and west.\nYou also have a fantastic view to the famous La Concha mountain.\nSince the villa is south facing you will have sun from early morning to late night.\n\nOn the main level you will find a living room, an open plan kitchen, a TV room, an ensuite guest bedroom and a guest toilet.\nOn the 1st floor is an ensuite guest bedroom with its own beautiful terrace, and the huge main bedroom with a walk in closet and a private terrace of 60m2.\nOn the ground floor you will find another TV room, 2 ensuite bedrooms and the garage.\nHere you will also find an additional ‌entertainment ‌area ‌that ‌is ‌built ‌under the ‌terrace with ‌a bar, wine cellar and ‌living ‌space. ‌On ‌the ‌terrace outside is the ‌gym ‌and ‌another ‌guest ‌bathroom ‌and ‌shower."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Golf","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca del Mar","Sur","Excelente","Reformado Recientemente","Privada","Aire Acondicionado","Chimenea","Mar","Montaña","Golf","Panorámicas","Terraza Privada","Gimnasio","Bar","Barbacoa","Fibra óptica","Equipada","Privado","Agua Potable","Paneles Solares Térmicas","Lujo"],"en":["Close To Golf","Close To Shops","Close To Sea","South","Excellent","Recently Renovated","Private","Air Conditioning","Fireplace","Sea","Mountain","Golf","Panoramic","Private Terrace","Gym","Bar","Barbeque","Fiber Optic","Fully Fitted","Private","Drinkable Water","Solar water heating","Luxury"]},"piscina":true,"parking":false,"jardin":true,"estado":"Available","gps":{},"energia":{"CO2Rated":"","CO2Value":"","EnergyRated":"","EnergyValue":"","Image":""},"gastos":{"comunidad":"300","ibi":"2,420","basura":"350"}}